            "text_zxhQVj": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Picking a vaporizer isn't just a spec sheet decision, it's about matching the device to how you actually session. Torch-powered and analog, or rechargeable and pocket-fast? Bold and blacked-out, or chrome and classic?</p><p>This guide breaks down what actually matters before you buy a premium device: heating method, chamber size, build, portability, and upkeep. Whether you're picking your first Hippie Pipe or upgrading your setup, start here.</p><p>Among our lineup, <strong>OM Chrome</strong> and the <strong>OM Gunmetal / OM Rose Gold</strong> battery line represent two different philosophies, one pure analog, one rechargeable convenience. Here's what sets each apart.</p>",
