                "text_JnnrEK": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.description",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>This is the biggest fork in the road. The Hippie Pipe, Pipe X, and OM Chrome are 100% analog, torch-powered, zero electronics, nothing to charge or that can die on you mid-session. OM Gunmetal and OM Rose Gold trade that for rechargeable, battery-powered convenience, no torch needed, just charge and go.</p><p>Neither is \"better\", it's about what fits your ritual. Want full manual control and nothing to plug in? Go analog. Want fast, low-effort hits without carrying a torch? Go battery.</p>",
